 .net/Conferences/2026/Dates\nLocation: Malmo\, Sweden\nTopics: Computer V
 ision & Pattern Recognition\, Deep Representation Learning\, Machine Lear
 ning\nSize: XXL\nSubmission type: Paper-based / Springer proceedings\nCon
 fidence: confirmed\nLast checked date: 2026-10-07\nNotes: Completed 2026 
