 ticipants.\nScope: Broad research in visual perception\, representation l
 earning\, recognition\, segmentation\, 3D geometry and reconstruction\, c
 omputational imaging\, and image/video synthesis. Vision-language models\
 , multimodal understanding\, human motion and appearance\, and robust vis
 ual systems extend this core. ECCV is the biennial European flagship for 
